# Core

- Match `{{cookiecutter.project_slug}}/users/` — do not invent parallel layouts.
- Never `git commit` / `git push`. Never open a browser unless asked.
- Never commit secrets or log tokens/passwords.
- New apps: `python manage.py start_domain_app <plural>` only.
- Layers: APIs glue; serializers = HTTP; TypedDict = service `data=`; selectors read; services write.
- Envelope: `api_response` → `{success,status,result,messages}`. Default **IsAuthenticated**.
- Infra/env/Docker/broker changes → reply section `### ⚠️ Infrastructure & Deployment Action Required`.
- Deep detail: open **one** page from `AGENTS.md` table — never bulk-read `docs/style-guide/`.
